897
01:09:28,319 --> 01:09:38,359
sum over its nk of e to the
beta mu minus epsilon of k nk.

898
01:09:45,189 --> 01:09:49,069
Now, the symmetry issues remain.

899
01:09:49,069 --> 01:09:53,180
This answer still
