beta mu minus epsilon of k.

917
01:11:26,950 --> 01:11:31,260
Actually, for future
reference note

918
01:11:31,260 --> 01:11:35,350
that I would be able to
do this geometric sum

919
01:11:35,350 --> 01:11:39,830
